This month’s Adventurer’s Challenge is stacked with Heretic-themed rewards, straight from the minds of Albion’s most explosive faction. Among them is their most unhinged creation yet: the Heretic Combat Mule. Earn Challenge Points through open-world mayhem to unlock this barely functional combat beast, bolted with creaky wooden cannons and fueled by pure madness. Crack open chests stuffed with volatile surprises, and ride like you're one loose screw away from glory. But hurry! That makeshift cannon doesn't look very stable...

Mighty Mules and Heretic Decor//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/3a6bf05566265ce250cb8b7b0f6c63d000c0c515.png
HERETIC COMBAT MULE: This month's Challenge brings back the Heretic Combat Mule, a war machine from the twisted minds of Heretic saddlers. The Combat Mule fires a powerful cannon shot that knocks back and slows targets, but watch out for its massive recoil!

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/12fd582ccdfc7ca27aac7734ff0a698ab5718a81.png
AVATAR RING: Adventurers who rack up enough total Challenge Points will also earn the Heretic Challenge Avatar Ring. This non-tradable item permanently unlocks this crazed, ramshackle avatar border for one character, or can be traded to the Vanity Merchant for one Adventurer's Token.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/f0163d6a973a0ac3179a1159c5b1b49ff25b2356.png
SEASONAL SPECIALS: All month long, reach weekly goals to unlock Heretic Challenge Chests. In addition to valuable rewards like Adventurer's Tomes, Silver, and resources, you'll also have a chance to unlock special furniture items like the Heretic Lantern, Heretic Junkpile and Heretic Scarecrow.

[video autoplay="yes" loop="yes" muted="yes"]https://assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/video_/media/66c86d0c98bee_720.mp4[/video]

How to participate in the Adventurer's Challenge
The Adventurer's Challenge is a monthly event where you can earn exclusive rewards such as mounts, Tomes of Insight, bags of Silver, and more. By gathering, fishing, farming, and defeating monsters, you'll earn Challenge Points that fill daily, weekly, and monthly progress bars. To track your progress, open the Adventurer's Challenge UI by clicking on the Activities menu.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/bbe632b8c242dd9526c11b8d54741acce88fee5a.png

While only Premium players can unlock the Monthly Rewards (Avatar Ring, Mount) and Weekly Rewards (Challenge Chests), anyone can claim the Daily Rewards, which include 10 Learning Points and a Tier 4 Tome of Insight. Non-Premium players also make progress on all reward tracks, so when you’re ready to unlock Premium, your earned rewards will be waiting for you!

AlbionTV continues its interview series bringing the spotlight to the AOCP Ambassadors introduced with the Abyssal Depths update. This week, the spotlight is on Megz. Tune in to twitch.tv/albiononline this Friday, August 29 at 20:00 UTC for a live interview with one of Albion’s most community-driven and warmhearted streamers.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/2be6ebc0742da4a730338a9a448bc063aed74fb6.png

Megz	Twitch: twitch.tv/megz	Discord: discord.gg/UN5aXmpEdd	Main Focus: Community / Long-stream contentMegz never planned to be a streamer, let alone an AOCP Ambassador. In fact, she says she hated the game at first. But when her husband, fellow Ambassador Nazori, asked her to help edit his videos, she gave Albion another chance, and this time it stuck. What began as a reluctant favor quickly became her passion, and today she’s one of the game’s most wholesome voices.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/4ea14afd4e8688266bf66aacc5f8322cb552a690.png

Unlike many creators, Meggy doesn’t run a Youtube channel. Her content isn’t about flashy highlight reels or clutch plays, it’s about being present with her community. Every stream is centered on spending time together, sharing laughs, trading sassy jokes, and building connections. And if that’s not enough, her Twitch bot dishes out questionable Albion-themed pick-up lines to keep everyone on their toes.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/53653410659376d721c2e61590c07ca6d704ef7c.png

Outside of the game, Megz is a mum of four and often channels that same “mama bear” energy into Albion. She runs an active guild, guiding her “guild babies” with patience and humor. Under her leadership, they’ve reached back-to-back Gold rankings – not bad for someone who calls herself “below average skill-wise”. She also organizes the long-running 20v20 Extravaganza on AlbionTV, now thriving across both Albion Americas and Europe.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/c27d10b28005991749f3cb833a6212436905232d.png

As an Ambassador, Megz fosters a more welcoming environment in Albion: drawing in new players, creating community, and proving you don’t need to be top tier to make a difference. So if you’re after content that’s equal parts wholesome, chaotic, and hilarious, Megz is the one to watch. Catch her live interview this Friday at 20:00 UTC for more laughs, a shot at winning the Priest vanity bundle, and perhaps the chance to learn a pick-up line or two.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/ee8123ef823b04921923ea97e407d1ba8061b520.jpeg

The heavens open, and with them a chance to walk the sacred path. Throughout this month’s Divine Challenge, earn Challenge Points from open-world activities to unlock chests overflowing with celestial rewards. At the journey’s peak awaits the Divine Owl: a radiant mount of gleaming white, whose wings carry not just its rider, but a blessing of divine protection. Claim heavenly riches and let your spirit shine before this sacred season fades.

Simply Divine//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/3f4f7ce5d48107bff83a2c1d288e830a351c9b57.png
DIVINE OWL: This month's Challenge brings back this ghostly white flying mount with a brisk base move speed. This mount has a special ability, Foresight, which creates a shield that gives a temporary speed boost when broken. (Note: like all mounts, the Divine Owl can only move in navigable ground areas and cannot fly over obstacles.)

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/a2744f3b0071de40e5a6a4880bd74c9b6dce365f.png
AVATAR RING: Adventurers who rack up enough total Challenge Points will also earn the Divine Challenge Avatar Ring, which will frame your chosen avatar in a heavenly golden aura. This non-tradable item permanently unlocks this avatar border for one character, or can be traded to the Vanity Merchant for one Vanity Token.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/2392d9c853ad99fe5b741229282058dde321c0e1.png
SEASONAL SPECIALS: All month long, reach weekly goals to unlock Divine Challenge chests. In addition to valuable rewards like Adventurer's Tomes and Silver, you'll also have a chance to unlock mystical furniture items like the Mage Statue, Magic Rune Circle, and Glass Sphere.

