If you’ve visited the Antiquarian’s Den in Albion, there’s a good chance you’ve met an adorable little creature down there. No, not the Antiquarian, but the Antiquarian’s cute companion – a friendly Baby Soulspinner. Ask what this sidekick is called, though, and you’ll just be met with a shrug. The poor thing doesn’t even have a name!

So it’s time for you, the players, to fix that. Until July 10 we’re running a contest where you get to choose this humble hatchling’s name, with the winning entry visible ingame for all to see! To enter, you need to take a screenshot of your character with the Antiquarian’s Soulspinner, and propose a name for it. For full details, and to take part, see this forum thread.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/43faf3d8c0594d5b1ede71644fe78ab92b63df15.png

As well as the opportunity to have your creativity etched into history, there are a bunch of other prizes on offer too – here’s the full list:
	First place: Your chosen name immortalized ingame, and an exclusive Albion Online merch pack	Second place: The Corrupted Preacher Vanity Bundle and 30 days Premium	Third place: Either the Corrupted Preacher Vanity Bundle or 30 days PremiumWe’re excited to see what you come up with, so get your creative juices flowing and show us what you’ve got. Let’s give this creature the name it deserves!

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/d65b5bd2d1bacf537bf32f5b476a836713c94e7f.png

The AOCP Ambassadors are a group of dedicated Albion Online streamers, bringing you top-tier Albion content day after day. And with Abyssal Depths now live, we’re excited to announce the new cohort! So, without further ado, we bring you…
	Ninuschk (twitch.tv/ninuschk)	Nazori (twitch.tv/nazori)	ProfessorPewPew (twitch.tv/pr0fessorpewpew)	BernStoneTV (twitch.tv/bernstone)	Scribbleloops (twitch.tv/scribbleloops)	Megz (twitch.tv/megz)	ElPelotasssss (twitch.tv/elpelotasssss)	Sankt (twitch.tv/sankt)These Ambassadors will be serving up the finest Albion Online content in their own inimitable fashion – and what’s more, for the next two weeks they’re each giving away the brand-new Corrupted Preacher vanity bundle! Tune into their streams for details on how to win this twisted new wardrobe and mount skin bundle.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/4cd1325747a65e25f822aa46b6c8571bb58b3aa2.png

The AlbionTV (twitch.tv/albiononline) crew will be bringing you exclusive interviews with the Ambassadors over the coming weeks, so keep your eyes out for more info. In the meantime, tune in, sit back, and enjoy the content!

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/60b25fbc89db873dd26fcab3de3ac54c27004c0e.jpeg

The barrier between worlds grows thin, and with it comes the chance to claim one of Albion’s most coveted mounts. Join the Undead Challenge and earn Challenge Points to unlock the Spectral Direboar, a mount wreathed in green mist, feared for its power to vanish from sight. Ride unseen through danger, gather eerie treasures, and let your legend haunt the living before the month ends.

Live Your Best Afterlife//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/fd24c8f3d5e64c4ca4ad83f74fd296cbd0eb18cd.png
SPECTRAL DIREBOAR: This month's Challenge brings back the popular Spectral Direboar, a ghostly mount with a unique spell, Glimpse of the Other Side, which renders you temporarily invisible. Use it to evade your enemies... or to launch a sneak attack!

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/0cde316db323f273b9fc82256e335dea38e1cd68.png
AVATAR RING: Adventurers who rack up enough total Challenge Points will also earn the Undead Challenge Avatar Ring, featuring a spooky skull-themed design that will strike fear into the hearts of your foes. This non-tradable item permanently unlocks this avatar border for one character, or can be traded to the Vanity Merchant for one Vanity Token.

//assets.albiononline.com/uploads/media/default/media/e7f9ed6aab011a3673afb594f44b6ade53ba581c.png
SEASONAL SPECIALS: All month long, reach weekly goals to unlock Undead Challenge chests. In addition to valuable rewards like Adventurer's Tomes and Silver, you'll also have a chance to unlock spooky furniture items like the Candelabra, Lantern, and Memorial of the Fallen, as well as rare and valuable Undead Vanity Skins.

